  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Foster dialogue on pathways for a revitalized Middle East Peace Process</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Overall Objective&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build conditions for regional comprehensive peace and the emergence of a unified and more democratic Palestinian polity. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Specific Objectives &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.&lt;/strong&gt;To support dialogue for regional comprehensive peace among relevant regional and international actors, ensuring policy inputs from the Women&#xbf;s Advisory Council. &lt;em&gt;[Workstream 1: Support to Regional Comprehensive Peace]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2.&lt;/strong&gt;To mitigate the internal Palestinian crisis by supporting an informal intra-Palestinian dialogue process to explore options for a viable roadmap towards Palestinian reunification and a more effective and democratic Palestinian political system. &lt;em&gt;[Workstream 2: Intra-Palestinian dialogue process]&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
